</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>As David cared for sheep out on the hills,</l><l>He prayed and sang and how his heart was filled!</l><l>Bravely he face a lion and a bear,</l><l>Shielding the sheep from ev’ry danger there.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Sing, sing, sing! YES, sing unto the Lord!</l><l>Sing from our heart and strike a joyful chord!</l><l>Cheerfully we sing: it makes our faces grin!</l><l>Sing to the Lord again and again.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
